# Legacy vanilla simulator (deleted from this repo)
# NOTE: the leading "/" below is deliberate - those patterns are anchored to the
# repo root. An unanchored pattern like "models/" matches at ANY depth, so it
# silently ignored new files under site/ (e.g. site/models/*.lib) at `git add`
# time - no warning, no error, file just never got committed.
# The tool/editor dirs above (node_modules, .vscode, .idea, .cursor) stay
# unanchored on purpose: ignoring them at any depth is the intended behavior.
/src/
/styles/
/lib/
/vendor/
/models/
